# Search across folders, watch the hit, move it up the Watched list.
Source docs/tapes/settings.tape
Output docs/public/media/search-watch.mp4

Hide
Type "clear && jenklod-batman" Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Space
Sleep 1s
Show
Sleep 1.5s
Type "/"
Sleep 500ms
Type "cowl"
Sleep 1.2s
Enter
Sleep 600ms
Type "w"
Sleep 1.5s
Escape
Sleep 1.5s
Type "j" Sleep 250ms Type "j" Sleep 250ms Type "j"
Sleep 500ms
Type "K"
Sleep 500ms
Type "K"
Sleep 500ms
Type "K"
Sleep 2.5s
Screenshot docs/public/media/watched-reordered.png
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
